cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or build on our findings, please cite the paper below.
title: Spoken Multi-hop RAG
abstract: >-
  Evaluation suite for studying how upstream ASR errors propagate through
  multi-hop retrieval-augmented generation, covering three multi-hop QA
  benchmarks, four English accents, and four RAG configurations.
type: software
authors:
